# =============================================================
# V360 Purchase Order Connector — Coleção de requests
# =============================================================
# Pré-requisito: docker compose up
# Extensão VS Code: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
# =============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

# ── 1. AUTH ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

