### Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "COLE_O_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "COLE_O_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

# ── 2. INGESTÃO ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Ingerir Alfa Energia (JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest/alfa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchase_orders": [
    {
      "po_number": "4500001234",
      "created_at": "2026-08-05",
      "status": "open",
      "currency": "BRL",
      "vendor": { "tax_id": "23456789000101", "name": "Metalúrgica São Jorge S.A." },
      "items": [
        {
          "line": 10,
          "material": "MAT-1001",
          "description": "Chapa de aço 2mm",
          "uom": "UN",
          "quantity_ordered": 100,
          "quantity_received": 60,
          "unit_price": 45.9
        },
        {
          "line": 20,
          "material": "MAT-1002",
          "description": "Perfil U 3m",
          "uom": "UN",
          "quantity_ordered": 50,
          "quantity_received": 0,
          "unit_price": 128.75
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}


### Ingerir Beta Alimentos (multipart — requer dois arquivos CSV)
# Salve os arquivos abaixo como cabecalho.csv e itens.csv e ajuste os caminhos
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest/beta
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cabecalho"; filename="cabecalho.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

NUMERO_PEDIDO;FORNECEDOR_CNPJ;FORNECEDOR_RAZAO_SOCIAL;EMISSAO;SITUACAO;MOEDA
20260088412;12.345.678/0001-90;Distribuidora Horizonte Ltda;15/08/2026;EM ABERTO;BRL
20260088413;98.765.432/0001-55;Frigorífico Boa Mesa S.A.;01/08/2026;BLOQUEADO;BRL
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="itens"; filename="itens.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

NUMERO_PEDIDO;ITEM;CODIGO_MATERIAL;DESCRICAO;UNIDADE;QTD_PEDIDA;QTD_RECEBIDA;PRECO_UNITARIO
20260088412;1;MAT-77;Óleo de soja 900ml;UN;1.200,000;400,000;6,49
20260088412;2;MAT-78;Açúcar refinado 1kg;UN;500,000;0,000;4,15
20260088413;1;MAT-91;Carne bovina dianteiro kg;KG;2.000,000;0,000;27,90
------Boundary--

# ── 3. HEALTH ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health
